      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "In a double-blind study, the influence of Visken on the effect of anticoagulant therapy with Marcoumar was examined. In comparison to a placebo group, neither any influence on the Quick time, nor any increased tendency to haemorrhage bleeding could be detected."},
